{'symbol': 'BXP', 'date': '2022-01-20 08:15:00', 'title': 'BOSTON PROPERTIES PARTNERS WITH SENSEWARE TO ENHANCE INDOOR AIR QUALITY MONITORING AND PROACTIVE MANAGEMENT CAPABILITIES', 'text': "BOSTON, JAN. 20, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SENSEWARE TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT BOSTON PROPERTIES, INC. (NYSE: BXP), THE LARGEST PUBLICLY TRADED DEVELOPER, OWNER, AND MANAGER OF CLASS A OFFICE PROPERTIES IN THE UNITED STATES, HAS SELECTED SENSEWARE'S TECHNOLOGY SOLUTION TO IMPLEMENT REAL-TIME INDOOR AIR QUALITY (IAQ) MONITORING ACROSS BXP'S PORTFOLIO AS PART OF ITS HEALTHY BUILDING STRATEGY. SENSEWARE'S AIR QUALITY MONITORING TECHNOLOGY IS THE LATEST ADDITION TO BXP'S HEALTHY BUILDING INITIATIVES."}